# Agent tools

## Do

- Call curated tools only. Never translate a user prompt into SQL or another authoritative language.
- Define tools in the mcp-gateway catalog (`src/tools/`) with a name `<domain>_<verb>_<object>`, annotations, and `outputSchema`.
- Execute the tool in the owning service. The gateway maps and calls.
- Audit denials.

## Do not

- Add a text-to-SQL tool, a raw SQL binding for agents, or a second tool catalog.
- Let the gateway contain domain queries.
